  "06e4ddd4-f677-4c35-8fb1-20608e01b1f5"],
 " draws six pulses from Alice to Bob at ",
 StyleBox["v", "TI"],
 " = 0.6. The first emission interval \[CapitalDelta]\[Tau] and its reception \
interval ",
 StyleBox["k", "TI"],
 "\[CapitalDelta]\[Tau] are marked."
}], "Item",ExpressionUUID->"b0406be2-c5d9-473f-84f5-a13379698678"],

